--- !u!114 &5502979871500384283
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7101881412502460351}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.3529412, g: 0.68235296, b: 0.18823531, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 01e7e133c00f9d04da4979d05ab55908, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 40
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 1
    m_MaxSize: 100
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<color=#242FB6>1. How can I withdraw cash?</color>\nThere are cash rewards
    for each level you pass. The more levels you pass, the more rewards you get.
    You can withdraw cash once you meet the withdrawal requirements.\n\n<color=#242FB6>2.
    How long does it take to withdraw money?</color>\nGenerally, funds will be credited
    to your account within a few minutes. If the number of withdrawals or the withdrawal
    amount exceeds a certain limit, the system will review it. In this case, the
    funds will still be credited within 24 hours, so please don\u2019t worry.\n\n<color=#242FB6>3.
    Why did my withdrawal fail?</color>\nIf the withdrawal fails, the withdrawal
    amount will be returned automatically. You can update your information and initiate
    the withdrawal again. Please make sure all the information you provide is correct.
    We are not responsible for withdrawal failures caused by incorrect information.\n\n<color=#242FB6>4.
    How many times can I withdraw?</color>\nUnlimited.\n\n<color=#242FB6>5. Can I
    use a VPN?</color>\nThe use of VPN is strictly prohibited. Please do not use
    a VPN while using the app."
